  <h2>We support the parents, too</h2>
  <p>Here's something we tell every parent: you are not being graded, and you are not the problem to be fixed. A child's therapy works best when the grown-ups around them are part of it. So alongside the child's sessions, we coach parents on what's going on underneath the behavior and how to respond in a way that actually helps. You know your child better than anyone. We just add a set of tools.</p>
  <p>Children's work here is a particular focus of Rozy, one of the associate therapists Kay personally supervises. On your free call, we'll make sure your child is matched with the right fit, so the very first session lands.</p>
